The '''2022 Milton Keynes Council election''' took place on 5 May 2022 to elect members of [[Milton Keynes Council]]. This was on the same day as [[2022 United Kingdom local elections|other local elections]].

One third of the council was up for election.<ref>{{Cite news |date=2022-04-25 |title=England Elections 2022: Political parties share plans for Milton Keynes |language=en-GB |work=BBC News |url=https://www.bbc.com/news/uk-england-beds-bucks-herts-61182098 |access-date=2022-04-26}}</ref>

